# /etc/velexis/reference-loader.env — used ONLY by velexis-deploy (deploy.sh) to load the vendored reference data
# (tools/reference-data, dist/cli/load.js) when the datasets changed. Owner root:root, mode 0600. Like migrator.env,
# systemd reads it for a transient unit with a dynamic user, so the DSN never reaches a process that an app user
# owns or a command line, and no app unit can read it (ADR-0026).
# The loader's only DSN: role velexis_platform_app, DML on `reference` (ADR-0024). The migrator DSN is not here.
DATABASE_URL=postgres://velexis_platform_app:@@PLATFORM_DB_PASSWORD@@@127.0.0.1:5432/velexis
